{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"heading_align":"text-center"}},"1729879532b6df6fce":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"ph_breadcrumbs_app_block_TbGRLD":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/ph-breadcrumbs\/blocks\/app-block\/457dc635-4337-4779-8f31-361dd27778c8","settings":{"show_breadcrumbs":true,"color":"#e95a06","horizontal_alignment":"left","fontsize":16,"breadcrumb_font":"helvetica_n4","marginleft":0,"margintop":0,"marginright":0,"marginbottom":0,"show_home_link":true,"show_last_crumb":true,"home_page":"Home","home_url":"\/","all_uppercase":false,"use_slider":false,"article_use_tag":true,"separator":"<span> › <\/span>","css_tablet":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","css_mobile":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","custom_css":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","css_last_crumb":"\/* font-weight: medium; *\/","css_hover":"\/* text-decoration-line: underline; *\/","menus":"*"}}},"block_order":["ph_breadcrumbs_app_block_TbGRLD"],"settings":{"full_width":false}},"008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Rebuild Your Industrial Pumps","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h5>Save Time, Money, and the Environment<\/h5><p>When it comes to maintaining the efficiency and longevity of your industrial pumps, rebuilding is a cost-effective and eco-friendly solution. <\/p><p>At PumpRack, we specialize in providing top-notch industrial pump rebuilding services designed to meet the needs of various industries, including manufacturing, chemical processing, and water treatment. <\/p><p>Our expert team ensures that your pumps are restored to peak performance, helping you save on costs and reduce environmental impact.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-button-1":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"ASK US A QUESTION","button_link":"#","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-heading-1","template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-text-1","template--14762286186582__008bb8b3-ecd5-425c-84f9-672fe2838b84-button-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Warehouse1RoundedWide.png","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"right","image_fit":"contain","media_width":40,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"none"}},"rich_text_KRA4Re":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_R7NW6x":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Why Choose Our Industrial Pump Rebuilding?","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"text_zz784x":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our speciality, remanufacturing pumps, is the bread and butter of what we do at PumpRack. We currently have three full-time pump technicians with years of combined experience. We especially love to work with Viking pumps and other positive displacement pumps, but of course love each pump we fix up.<\/p><p>Here’s a little more about our background, and why you can trust us to rebuild your industrial pump.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_R7NW6x","text_zz784x"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"media_with_text_3aUHQ9":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"heading_rmNXDK":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"High Parts Standards and Strict Cleaning + Rebuilding Protocol","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"text_hGCG7X":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>We don’t take a Sherwin Williams approach to your rebuild. Instead of simply cleaning your pump, repainting it, and calling it a day like how other pump companies operate, we take things seriously.<\/p><p>Every pump is meticulously disassembled and each part carefully inspected for damage. Worn parts are measured to confirm they’re still within factory and application tolerances. <\/p><p>If we need to replace anything that falls outside those specifications and tolerances, we use new, used, or aftermarket parts that are ten times better than the old ones. Additionally, all soft parts are replaced with new ones, including gaskets, o-rings, seals, packing, bearings, and more.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_rmNXDK","text_hGCG7X"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/EthanShop1RoundedWide.png","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"left","image_fit":"contain","media_width":45,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"none"}},"95eb41ff-5961-4c33-bc7a-ea7ed5a2bb64":{"type":"collection-list-v2","blocks":{"template--14865674633302__95eb41ff-5961-4c33-bc7a-ea7ed5a2bb64-collection-1":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"viking-pumps"}},"template--14865674633302__95eb41ff-5961-4c33-bc7a-ea7ed5a2bb64-collection-2":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"imo-pumps"}},"template--14865674633302__95eb41ff-5961-4c33-bc7a-ea7ed5a2bb64-collection-3":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"moyno-pumps"}},"template--14865674633302__95eb41ff-5961-4c33-bc7a-ea7ed5a2bb64-collection-4":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"waukesha-pumps"}},"d8389c99-5f7a-40ef-87b4-29853d48c98b":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"ingersoll-rand-pumps"}},"985fc672-fb48-4abe-a13f-ff3c05940be6":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"price-pumps"}},"5a371cf2-d6bd-422a-b637-8b1fba688076":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"wilden-pumps"}},"f3477265-ed0f-441f-b758-0a09d71719a4":{"type":"collection","settings":{"collection":"brown-sharpe-pumps"}}},"block_order":["template--14865674633302__95e