ll. Minimum 1-year warranty on everything.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14762286186582__7c201f0f-3751-4ab7-87bb-74c56ec2ceb2-column-1","template--14762286186582__7c201f0f-3751-4ab7-87bb-74c56ec2ceb2-column-2","template--14762286186582__7c201f0f-3751-4ab7-87bb-74c56ec2ceb2-column-3","ef23c01d-a602-4f2d-a528-f36c1dc68c11"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","heading_align":"text-center","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"small","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-left","image_ratio":"natural","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}},"8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1dec28ca6ea5":{"type":"image-banner-v2","blocks":{"template--14762286186582__8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1dec28ca6ea5-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Get Your Pump Rebuilt Today","heading_size":"h2","heading_h1":false}},"template--14762286186582__8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1dec28ca6ea5-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Rest assured, when you choose us for your pump rebuilds, we’ll exceed your expectations and get your pump working again in no time. With our rigorous processes and strict standards, each pump looks as if it came right off the assembly line.<\/p><p>Additionally, <em>all <\/em>of our remanufactured pumps come with a warranty! Depending on the type of pump, we offer at least a year’s warranty - with a maximum of five years! To see what type of warranty your pump qualifies for, and to get your pump rebuilt, give us a call today!<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"template--14762286186582__8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1dec28ca6ea5-button-1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_1_label":"Contact Us","button_1_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact","button_1_style":"btn btn--primary","button_2_label":"","button_2_link":"","button_2_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["template--14762286186582__8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1dec28ca6ea5-heading-1","template--14762286186582__8cadb3bf-3119-42f6-a6e2-1